#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:2
#: 778893878abc4e34815f5f3bf85ec1a6
msgid "ToolUniverse Architecture"
msgstr "ToolUniverse 架构"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:4
#: f31f6a003a4d45c09a2e5bbcfdec4eb0
msgid ""
"This document provides a technical overview of ToolUniverse's "
"architecture, helping you understand how the system works internally."
msgstr "本文档提供了ToolUniverse架构的技术概述，帮助您了解系统的内部工作原理。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:7
#: 37b9a182ce2345aabf29a4390408f38e
msgid "System Overview"
msgstr "系统概述"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:9
#: 63291e33a5914b6eb1215485c6f7cba4
msgid ""
"ToolUniverse is built around a modular, registry-based architecture that "
"supports both local and remote tools through a unified interface."
msgstr "ToolUniverse 基于模块化的注册表架构构建，通过统一界面支持本地和远程工具。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:11
#: 6a1c0e18f8d24b29893c4c1512618960
msgid "**Core Components:**"
msgstr "**核心组件：**"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:30
#: b6b442c86a5b4d4c8edfb4c2498ad581
msgid ""
"**Key Design Principles:** - **Modularity**: Tools are independent "
"modules - **Extensibility**: Easy to add new tool types - **Unified "
"Interface**: Same API for local and remote tools - **Lazy Loading**: "
"Tools loaded on demand - **Error Isolation**: Tool failures don't crash "
"the system"
msgstr ""
"**关键设计原则：**  \n"
"- **模块化**：工具是独立的模块  \n"
"- **可扩展性**：易于添加新工具类型  \n"
"- **统一接口**：本地工具和远程工具使用相同的 API  \n"
"- **延迟加载**：按需加载工具  \n"
"- **错误隔离**：工具故障不会导致系统崩溃"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:38
#: 32083ccd8b4a430baaa4fcd75ad6491d
msgid "Tool Registry System"
msgstr "工具注册系统"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:40
#: e09de8af313e4f9291c614ba441ef81c
msgid ""
"**Local Tool Registry** The local tool registry manages Python-based "
"tools that run within the ToolUniverse process."
msgstr ""
"**本地工具注册表**  \n"
"本地工具注册表管理在 ToolUniverse 进程中运行的基于 Python 的工具。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:43
#: 9cb9296378064d74a8636406a62569ac
msgid ""
"**Registration Process:** 1. Tool class decorated with ``@register_tool``"
" 2. Tool metadata stored in registry 3. Tool available for discovery and "
"execution"
msgstr ""
"**注册流程：**  \n"
"1. 使用 ``@register_tool`` 装饰器标记工具类  \n"
"2. 工具元数据存储在注册表中  \n"
"3. 工具可用于发现和执行"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:48
#: e286340bfe6c46ebb4bacde94e907328
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``ToolRegistry``: Manages tool registration and "
"discovery - ``BaseTool``: Base class for all local tools - "
"``ToolMetadata``: Stores tool configuration and metadata"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``ToolRegistry``：管理工具注册和发现  \n"
"- ``BaseTool``：所有本地工具的基类  \n"
"- ``ToolMetadata``：存储工具配置和元数据"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:53
#: a343b15614514351bf8af33a9d26e6df
msgid ""
"**Remote Tool Registry** The remote tool registry manages external tools "
"accessed via MCP or REST APIs."
msgstr ""
"**远程工具注册表**  \n"
"远程工具注册表负责管理通过 MCP 或 REST API 访问的外部工具。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:56
#: 63348779543c44b7b8ad5503ebfabdfb
msgid ""
"**Registration Process:** 1. Tool configuration loaded from JSON files 2."
" MCP client connections established 3. Tool capabilities discovered and "
"registered"
msgstr ""
"**注册流程：**  \n"
"1. 从 JSON 文件加载工具配置  \n"
"2. 建立 MCP 客户端连接  \n"
"3. 发现并注册工具功能"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:61
#: a54abbd020ec4940b0229065b48c8f17
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``MCPToolRegistry``: Manages MCP tool connections - "
"``RemoteTool``: Wrapper for remote tool execution - ``MCPClientTool``: "
"Handles MCP protocol communication"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``MCPToolRegistry``：管理MCP工具连接  \n"
"- ``RemoteTool``：远程工具执行的包装器  \n"
"- ``MCPClientTool``：处理MCP协议通信"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:67
#: 1161030fe6544e798c86dda030436d9f
msgid "Tool Execution Engine"
msgstr "工具执行引擎"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:69
#: 60533537be0f452f8a70040c29cf0f3f
msgid ""
"**Execution Flow:** 1. **Request Parsing**: Parse tool name and arguments"
" 2. **Tool Discovery**: Find tool in registry 3. **Parameter "
"Validation**: Validate arguments against schema 4. **Tool Execution**: "
"Execute tool (local or remote) 5. **Result Processing**: Format and "
"return results 6. **Error Handling**: Handle and report errors"
msgstr ""
"**执行流程：**  \n"
"1. **请求解析**：解析工具名称和参数  \n"
"2. **工具发现**：在注册表中查找工具  \n"
"3. **参数验证**：根据模式验证参数  \n"
"4. **工具执行**：执行工具（本地或远程）  \n"
"5. **结果处理**：格式化并返回结果  \n"
"6. **错误处理**：处理并报告错误"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:77
#: f27e0af453f1483389b96097577f4b8d
msgid ""
"**Key Components:** - ``ToolExecutor``: Main execution engine - "
"``ParameterValidator``: Validates tool parameters - ``ResultProcessor``: "
"Formats tool results - ``ErrorHandler``: Manages error reporting"
msgstr ""
"**关键组件：**  \n"
"- ``ToolExecutor``：主要执行引擎  \n"
"- ``ParameterValidator``：验证工具参数  \n"
"- ``ResultProcessor``：格式化工具结果  \n"
"- ``ErrorHandler``：管理错误报告"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:83
#: 2da8a54a32b04fb99e0e1af0636bba2e
msgid ""
"**Execution Modes:** - **Synchronous**: Blocking execution for immediate "
"results - **Asynchronous**: Non-blocking execution for long-running tasks"
" - **Batch**: Execute multiple tools in sequence"
msgstr ""
"**执行模式：**  \n"
"- **同步**：阻塞执行以获取即时结果  \n"
"- **异步**：非阻塞执行以处理长时间运行的任务  \n"
"- **批处理**：按顺序执行多个工具"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:89
#: 9a32d81b005742379c6bde769f1b9165
msgid "Configuration System"
msgstr "配置系统"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:91
#: c537c34801e94827baa3b3e03b2e43d4
msgid ""
"**Configuration Hierarchy:** 1. **Default Configuration**: Built-in tool "
"configurations 2. **User Configuration**: User-provided configurations 3."
" **Runtime Configuration**: Dynamic configuration updates"
msgstr ""
"**配置层次结构：**  \n"
"1. **默认配置**：内置工具配置  \n"
"2. **用户配置**：用户提供的配置  \n"
"3. **运行时配置**：动态配置更新"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:96
#: 3ac5bf8ed9ab4f21b9bbd93a58efe3d4
msgid ""
"**Configuration Sources:** - JSON files in ``data/`` directory - "
"Environment variables - Command-line arguments - Runtime API calls"
msgstr ""
"**配置来源：**  \n"
"- ``data/`` 目录中的 JSON 文件  \n"
"- 环境变量  \n"
"- 命令行参数  \n"
"- 运行时 API 调用"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:102
#: 5940c9bea75b4eadaf4d1a5756304f52
msgid ""
"**Configuration Validation:** - JSON Schema validation - Type checking - "
"Required field validation - Dependency resolution"
msgstr ""
"**配置验证：**  \n"
"- JSON Schema 验证  \n"
"- 类型检查  \n"
"- 必填字段验证  \n"
"- 依赖关系解析"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:108
#: 06030d76232d4193b155a1ef2b290a47
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``ConfigManager``: Manages configuration loading and "
"validation - ``ToolConfig``: Represents individual tool configuration - "
"``ConfigValidator``: Validates configuration schemas"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``ConfigManager``：负责管理配置加载和验证  \n"
"- ``ToolConfig``：表示单个工具的配置  \n"
"- ``ConfigValidator``：用于验证配置模式"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:114
#: 5bb61ddfcd7444bcb33cd5fe60c82037
msgid "MCP Integration"
msgstr "MCP 集成"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:116
#: 108df26e2a974a87a3c9614b6c657649
msgid ""
"**MCP (Model Context Protocol)** MCP provides a standardized way to "
"integrate external tools and services."
msgstr "**MCP（模型上下文协议）** MCP 提供了一种标准化的方法，用于集成外部工具和服务。"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:119
#: f3b4025660ee4990b114ced6c4c72095
msgid ""
"**MCP Components:** - **MCP Server**: External service providing tools - "
"**MCP Client**: ToolUniverse component connecting to servers - **MCP "
"Protocol**: Communication protocol between client and server"
msgstr ""
"**MCP组件：**  \n"
"- **MCP服务器**：提供工具的外部服务  \n"
"- **MCP客户端**：连接到服务器的ToolUniverse组件  \n"
"- **MCP协议**：客户端与服务器之间的通信协议"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:124
#: 6f72b3eb0a224eb0b39645e2c5b36d1e
msgid ""
"**MCP Features:** - **Tool Discovery**: Automatic discovery of available "
"tools - **Parameter Validation**: Server-side parameter validation - "
"**Error Handling**: Standardized error reporting - **Authentication**: "
"Secure communication protocols"
msgstr ""
"**MCP 功能：**  \n"
"- **工具发现**：自动发现可用工具  \n"
"- **参数验证**：服务器端参数验证  \n"
"- **错误处理**：标准化错误报告  \n"
"- **身份验证**：安全通信协议"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:130
#: e7150dcc973f4c7f8be9a7055a7388ff
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``MCPClient``: Handles MCP protocol communication - "
"``MCPServer``: Base class for MCP servers - ``MCPTool``: Represents MCP-"
"based tools"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``MCPClient``：处理 MCP 协议通信  \n"
"- ``MCPServer``：MCP 服务器的基类  \n"
"- ``MCPTool``：表示基于 MCP 的工具"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:135
#: 68acb64923ef443889e11c389d0ad25e
msgid ""
"**MCP Communication Flow:** 1. **Connection**: Establish connection to "
"MCP server 2. **Discovery**: Query available tools and capabilities 3. "
"**Registration**: Register tools in local registry 4. **Execution**: "
"Execute tools via MCP protocol 5. **Result Handling**: Process and return"
" results"
msgstr ""
"**MCP通信流程：**  \n"
"1. **连接**：建立与MCP服务器的连接  \n"
"2. **发现**：查询可用工具和功能  \n"
"3. **注册**：将工具注册到本地注册表  \n"
"4. **执行**：通过MCP协议执行工具  \n"
"5. **结果处理**：处理并返回结果"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:143
#: d117b11668c5492da977b86f7388dff9
msgid "Error Handling and Logging"
msgstr "错误处理与日志记录"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:145
#: 87371b2cddc5493b9a631b8f50c422e1
msgid ""
"**Error Types:** - **Validation Errors**: Parameter validation failures -"
" **Execution Errors**: Tool execution failures - **Network Errors**: "
"Remote tool connection failures - **System Errors**: Internal system "
"failures"
msgstr ""
"**错误类型：**  \n"
"- **验证错误**：参数验证失败  \n"
"- **执行错误**：工具执行失败  \n"
"- **网络错误**：远程工具连接失败  \n"
"- **系统错误**：内部系统故障"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:151
#: 82afe646fff7430abbef5dae8a1779f7
msgid ""
"**Error Handling Strategy:** - **Graceful Degradation**: System continues"
" with partial failures - **Error Isolation**: Tool failures don't affect "
"other tools - **Detailed Logging**: Comprehensive error logging and "
"reporting - **User-Friendly Messages**: Clear error messages for users"
msgstr ""
"**错误处理策略：**  \n"
"- **优雅降级**：系统在部分故障情况下继续运行  \n"
"- **错误隔离**：工具故障不会影响其他工具  \n"
"- **详细日志记录**：全面的错误日志记录和报告  \n"
"- **用户友好的消息**：为用户提供清晰的错误信息"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:157
#: 0f9321c0fbf5436d893269c5b115d8c7
msgid ""
"**Logging System:** - **Structured Logging**: JSON-formatted log entries "
"- **Log Levels**: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL - **Log "
"Rotation**: Automatic log file rotation - **Remote Logging**: Optional "
"remote log aggregation"
msgstr ""
"**日志系统：**  \n"
"- **结构化日志记录**：JSON格式的日志条目  \n"
"- **日志级别**：DEBUG、INFO、WARNING、ERROR、CRITICAL  \n"
"- **日志轮换**：自动日志文件轮换  \n"
"- **远程日志记录**：可选的远程日志聚合"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:163
#: 93c5da0731e34325aa299f46b08f5139
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``ErrorHandler``: Centralized error handling - "
"``Logger``: Logging system - ``ErrorReporter``: Error reporting and "
"notification"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``ErrorHandler``：集中化错误处理  \n"
"- ``Logger``：日志系统  \n"
"- ``ErrorReporter``：错误报告与通知"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:169
#: c90514521ae548e68feca600163b0f93
msgid "Performance and Scalability"
msgstr "性能与可扩展性"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:171
#: 244e11e8801d4c6da3ef9715cf371d26
msgid ""
"**Performance Optimizations:** - **Lazy Loading**: Tools loaded on demand"
" - **Caching**: Result caching for expensive operations - **Connection "
"Pooling**: Reuse connections for remote tools - **Async Execution**: Non-"
"blocking tool execution"
msgstr ""
"**性能优化：**  \n"
"- **延迟加载**：按需加载工具  \n"
"- **缓存**：对耗时操作的结果进行缓存  \n"
"- **连接池**：重复利用远程工具的连接  \n"
"- **异步执行**：非阻塞式工具执行"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:177
#: 98ec84dd615c4d83a0b3bdc018047845
msgid ""
"**Scalability Features:** - **Horizontal Scaling**: Multiple ToolUniverse"
" instances - **Load Balancing**: Distribute load across instances - "
"**Resource Management**: Monitor and limit resource usage - **Auto-"
"scaling**: Automatic scaling based on load"
msgstr ""
"**可扩展性功能：**  \n"
"- **水平扩展**：支持多个 ToolUniverse 实例  \n"
"- **负载均衡**：在实例之间分配负载  \n"
"- **资源管理**：监控并限制资源使用  \n"
"- **自动扩展**：根据负载自动调整扩展"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:183
#: 6f0e538296c0453a8fec90301e91fdfe
msgid ""
"**Monitoring:** - **Performance Metrics**: Execution time, memory usage -"
" **Health Checks**: System and tool health monitoring - **Alerting**: "
"Automated alerting for failures - **Dashboards**: Real-time monitoring "
"dashboards"
msgstr ""
"**监控：**  \n"
"- **性能指标**：执行时间、内存使用情况  \n"
"- **健康检查**：系统和工具健康监控  \n"
"- **警报**：故障自动警报  \n"
"- **仪表板**：实时监控仪表板"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:189
#: f7a4c53b1e5b43eab4f84c21da958323
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``PerformanceMonitor``: Tracks performance metrics - "
"``ResourceManager``: Manages system resources - ``HealthChecker``: "
"Monitors system health"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``PerformanceMonitor``：跟踪性能指标  \n"
"- ``ResourceManager``：管理系统资源  \n"
"- ``HealthChecker``：监控系统运行状况"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:195
#: aa058bf49f124adda14fb3834a7648be
msgid "Security Considerations"
msgstr "安全注意事项"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:197
#: b7f6892a78264bbd8a5536ca96844e6d
msgid ""
"**Security Features:** - **Input Validation**: Strict parameter "
"validation - **Authentication**: Secure authentication for remote tools -"
" **Authorization**: Role-based access control - **Encryption**: Encrypted"
" communication for sensitive data"
msgstr ""
"**安全功能：**  \n"
"- **输入验证**：严格的参数验证  \n"
"- **身份验证**：远程工具的安全身份验证  \n"
"- **授权**：基于角色的访问控制  \n"
"- **加密**：敏感数据的加密通信"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:203
#: 666487f25dab4e88a80b3e271ff48651
msgid ""
"**Security Best Practices:** - **Principle of Least Privilege**: Minimal "
"required permissions - **Secure Defaults**: Secure configuration by "
"default - **Regular Updates**: Keep dependencies updated - **Security "
"Auditing**: Regular security audits"
msgstr ""
"**安全最佳实践：**  \n"
"- **最小权限原则**：仅授予最低必要权限  \n"
"- **安全默认值**：默认采用安全配置  \n"
"- **定期更新**：保持依赖项为最新版本  \n"
"- **安全审计**：定期进行安全审计"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:209
#: 77d5b8cf91ca4b0cbf74014b51f0b958
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``SecurityManager``: Manages security policies - "
"``Authenticator``: Handles authentication - ``Authorizer``: Manages "
"authorization"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``SecurityManager``：管理安全策略  \n"
"- ``Authenticator``：处理身份验证  \n"
"- ``Authorizer``：管理授权"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:215
#: c1c07c01d75a41d88a9471796527de0f
msgid "Testing Framework"
msgstr "测试框架"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:217
#: 5244b183d76648f8aa780607f78be25a
msgid ""
"**Testing Strategy:** - **Unit Tests**: Test individual components - "
"**Integration Tests**: Test component interactions - **End-to-End "
"Tests**: Test complete workflows - **Performance Tests**: Test system "
"performance"
msgstr ""
"**测试策略：**  \n"
"- **单元测试**：测试单个组件  \n"
"- **集成测试**：测试组件之间的交互  \n"
"- **端到端测试**：测试完整的工作流程  \n"
"- **性能测试**：测试系统性能"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:223
#: 23ce0b267450435394e9c867571daa5f
msgid ""
"**Testing Tools:** - **pytest**: Primary testing framework - **Mocking**:"
" Mock external dependencies - **Fixtures**: Reusable test components - "
"**Coverage**: Code coverage reporting"
msgstr ""
"**测试工具：**  \n"
"- **pytest**：主要测试框架  \n"
"- **Mocking**：模拟外部依赖  \n"
"- **Fixtures**：可重复使用的测试组件  \n"
"- **Coverage**：代码覆盖率报告"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:229
#: 34d6af9cfcc545a7bb3bfc89d0726f42
msgid ""
"**Key Classes:** - ``TestRunner``: Executes test suites - "
"``TestFixtures``: Provides test data and setup - ``MockTool``: Mock tool "
"for testing"
msgstr ""
"**关键类：**  \n"
"- ``TestRunner``：执行测试套件  \n"
"- ``TestFixtures``：提供测试数据和设置  \n"
"- ``MockTool``：用于测试的模拟工具"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:235
#: 76732a229afb498c8d8461752c104e4b
msgid "Development Guidelines"
msgstr "开发指南"

#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/architecture.rst:237
#: e385e2db31b7410fb09d5091d562667f
msgid ""
"**Code Organization:** - **Modular Design**: Clear separation of concerns"
" - **Interface Segregation**: Small, focused interfaces - **Dependency "
"Injection**: Loose coupling between components - **Configuration "
"Management**: Centralized configuration"
msgstr ""
"**代码组织：**  \n"
